WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:05.690
Long story short, your impedance 
is all over the place.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.640
Impedance?

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.260
It boils down to your feelings.

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:12.030
As a result, the fragment was stolen from us.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:17.240
Your impedances synchronized and triggered 
complete transformations this time,

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.910
but there's no guarantee you'll 
be able to transform again.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:25.650
We need to sync your impedances and 
get them as close to zero as possible!

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.330
But Yayaka got in our way!

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.630
The end result isn't the problem.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.050
The moment you two landed 
in different places,

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:35.760
that transfer was doomed to fail!

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:42.720
That's my school's uniform.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.140
Cocona and I will match!

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.060
Syncing your appearances 
is the best place to start.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.190
Hey!

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.740
And, on that note,

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.240
we want you two to live together for a while.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.080
Is this too much?

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.530
But it'll be a problem if I don't have enough.

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:40.930
Ah, jeez!

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:45.810
Live together?

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.630
To bring your impedances closer together,

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:52.250
you'll have to understand 
and accept each other.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.180
So we want you to eat the same food

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:56.570
and sleep under the same roof.

00:02:57.080 --> 00:03:00.720
Eat the same food and 
sleep under the same roof?

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.220
Like a sleepover?

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:03.710
A sleepover?!

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.040
But this is too sudden.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:09.070
This skill will be absolutely 
essential going forward.

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:11.210
We really need you to do this.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:13.170
Let's do it, Cocona!

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.190
No!

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:19.760
I can't make my grandmother worry any more.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.240
I saw that coming!

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:25.800
The real-time discrepancy in the last 
operation was caused by you two.

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:29.060
If you know the cause, 
then do something about it.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:34.440
What are you stocking up for?

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:42.750
Th-The thing is...

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:47.360
For a few days, starting tomorrow, 
I'll be with a friend at her place...

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:49.900
You're staying over?

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:52.750
I obviously can't, right?

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.670
Don't cause any trouble for them, okay?

00:03:58.520 --> 00:03:59.290
I won't.

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.070
Who are you?

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:37.630
Welcome back.

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:14.540
Cocona!

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:19.250
Morning!

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.170
Hey, that's...

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:24.590
We match starting today!

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:25.580
Not what I mean!

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:28.590
Wear it right.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.390
You're on your own next time.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.660
We're having a sleepover, huh?

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.080
It's just a camp.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.780
A camp?

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:44.440
Like for studying or training.

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.640
Anyway, we're not staying over for fun.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.700
But we <i>are</i> staying over.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.500
Hollo!

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:01.750
Hollo!

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.260
Yayaka's not here.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.260
Not here...

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.640
Hey, Cocona.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:12.760
Huh?

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.340
She hasn't come here yet.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:31.700
I'm sorry!

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:38.120
Art Prep Room

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.560
Excuse me.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:43.660
Is tea okay?

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:45.730
Yes, thank you.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:51.260
Here you go.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:54.850
Thank you very much.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:07.050
The weather's so nice today, 
I can't get any work done.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.280
I can't get anything done on 
rainy days, either, though.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.610
Not many days come along that are just right.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:23.960
Found you!

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:25.460
Papika?

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:26.590
Class is starting!

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.020
Whoa.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:30.990
I-I'm so sorry!

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:33.260
Uh, may I come again?

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:42.720
Where do you want to eat today?

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:43.710
The courtyard?

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:44.520
Yeah...

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:47.230
Hey.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:48.980
Wha—

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:51.030
Yayaka!

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:52.600
Why were you there?

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:53.670
Why'd you have it?!

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:54.780
Why—

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.620
This isn't the place.

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:09.630
Are you collecting them, too?

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.510
For far longer than you have.

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.010
Do you have lots?

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:18.820
Didn't you have something to say to me?

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:24.890
You're eating nothing but sweet bread again.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:27.150
You softie.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.150
You two.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:34.230
Do you wanna come with me?

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:38.240
The more numbers we have, 
the quicker we'll find the amorphous.

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:43.390
Are you telling us to join you?

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:45.580
No!

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:46.870
Papika?

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.170
Never!

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:49.620
Figures.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:54.110
Why are you collecting them? 
For what purpose?

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:56.760
World conquest.

00:08:57.710 --> 00:08:58.510
Huh?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.920
You don't know anything, do you?

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:03.480
Hey!

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:05.950
Wait!

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.660
I hate her!

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.520
That was a total lie.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:36.680
Isn't that crazy?

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:37.750
Where are we going?

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:39.090
Just come.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:40.680
Aren't we going home?

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.270
Of course we are.

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:48.410
Welcome!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:53.530
Aren't we staying over at FlipFlap?

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:56.320
Come on in.

00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:59.820
Th-Thanks for having me...

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.490
Look at this. I found it 
on a beach and colored it.

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:17.380
O-Oh?

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.100
It wasn't empty.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:22.860
Also...

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:25.720
Uskull!

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:28.380
Uexkull!

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:35.060
Why did you come with me?

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:37.180
I'm not going home today.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:39.660
Are you hungry?

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:42.010
Let's make dinner, then.

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:43.780
You help, too, Bu-chan.

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.700
Then let's go, Cocona.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:05.970
Sniff, sniff, sniff.

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.040
Here, Cocona.

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:18.460
Eap ut.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:28.960
All right, I will!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.080
Time to eat!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:36.700
What's this vegetable called? 
I've never had it before.

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:37.980
Dunno!

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:40.040
What about that bird, then?

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.470
Dunno!

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.550
This stuff <i>is</i> edible, right?

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.340
I'm eating it.

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:05.110
Cocona, get me the soap.

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:05.820
Hey!

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.450
You've got enough on you!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.400
But I want more.

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:09.920
Just get out!

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.830
What's the big deal?

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.720
Don't come here!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.400
Let's go to sleep, Cocona.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.090
School's out today.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:08.610
But we're still at school.

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:12.400
Me too, then!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:13.960
Okay.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.200
Let's go get food.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:19.400
Going to hunt eggs again?

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:20.470
Nah.

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:27.160
Fish!

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:46.430
You come, too, Cocona!

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:47.380
No, thanks.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:56.620
Yay! Got us lunch!

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:02.700
What's wrong?

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:03.530
It's gone!

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.950
The hoverboard's gone!

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:23.560
A deserted island?!

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:24.460
Yeah.

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.090
There's no one here.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.660
It's a secret island.

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:29.970
B-But, hey, we have Bu-chan.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.180
Please! We have exams the day after tomorrow!

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:39.100
Hey!

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.820
Hey!

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:42.610
Hey!

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:45.610
Hey!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.800
Hey!

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.720
Hey!

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:02.790
Nobody's coming.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.460
This way!

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:14.790
Wait!

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:17.280
Slow down, Papika!

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.230
Wait!

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:39.580
Forget this!

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:56.530
Papika?

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:22.440
Ow...

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:32.710
Cocona.

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:37.550
You're a mess.

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:40.560
Papika.

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:47.250
Here.

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:50.490
I got this for you.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.640
There's red fruit over there.

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:54.880
The red ones are bad.

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:56.560
They burn when you eat them.

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.850
You're amazing, Papika.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:08.080
I don't know anything.

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:10.670
I can't do anything.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:13.750
You're empty.

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.680
You have nothing.

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:18.200
I have nothing...

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:21.560
You can do lots of things!

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.960
You're smart!

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:25.900
You can read textbooks good!

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.400
You can walk fast!

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:29.030
And...

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.530
You can put the scarf on right!

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:47.540
Just right!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.550
Anybody can do that much!

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.880
Ta-da!

00:17:58.480 --> 00:17:59.500
What is this?

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:01.140
A bath!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.720
You'd better not look over 
here, no matter what!

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:06.850
No matter what! Got that?

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:07.690
Okay.

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:14.360
Hey!

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:15.470
So warm!

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:16.740
There's not enough room!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.890
It's all good!

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.620
Huh?!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:24.450
Oh, no!

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:25.280
Over there!

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:26.140
And here, too!

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.550
Plug it!

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:39.700
Want to try making a raft tomorrow?

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:40.720
A raft?

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:44.430
I've got exams the day after tomorrow, 
so I need to get back and review.

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:45.570
Huh...

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:46.870
You, too, you know.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.230
Ugh.

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:54.260
No shooting stars.

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:57.940
What do you want to wish for?

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:59.780
That we'll be back by the day after tomorrow!

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:01.590
That's not what I mean.

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:07.040
If you collect enough fragments, 
what will you wish for?

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:12.040
What's this wish you're 
willing to fight others for?

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:14.750
Secret.

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:17.110
What about you?

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:20.530
I don't have one in particular.

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:24.680
But I want to meet my family, I guess?

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.430
Family?

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:31.690
Ever since I was a child, 
I've been living with my grandmother.

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:36.860
My parents died in an accident 
when I was still a baby.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:38.690
I have no memory of them at all.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:40.950
That's why.

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:43.270
I see.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:45.560
Family.

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:47.760
Family, huh?

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:49.840
I'm sure you can meet them.

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:54.540
I met the person I wanted to meet, 
so I'm sure you'll meet them, too.

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:34.790
Let's do this, Cocona.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:35.530
Yeah.

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:37.340
One, two...

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:44.840
One, two...

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.470
Go!

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.950
Pure Illusion approaching!

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.360
Approaching!

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:10.580
Vortex

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:12.890
This way, Cocona!

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:17.170
It's happening!

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:18.680
Impedance levels down!

00:21:18.680 --> 00:21:19.920
They've begun synchronizing!

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:25.810
Rock, paper, scissors.

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:44.580
Don't worry.

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:46.570
I'll never let go.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:48.570
Really?

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.930
Never, ever!

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:54.920
Never, ever, ever!

00:21:57.260 --> 00:21:58.580
And I'll never go away.

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:34.300
Next time on <i>Flip Flappers:</i>

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:35.600
"Pure Echo."

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:37.370
Look forward to it.

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:38.730
She just said it normally.

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:40.600
Pure Echo

00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:40.260
That's Senpai for you.
